        "reflectionId": "reflection-h",
        "reflection": "That was the hardest one in the whole category. Your best friend let you down when you needed them most — and you found a way to forgive. 🌱 Here's the deepest truth in this app: forgiveness is mostly a gift to yourself. Holding a grudge is carrying a backpack of rocks that only weighs you down. Forgiving doesn't mean it was okay, it doesn't have to be instant, and you're allowed to say what it'll take to trust again. But choosing to set the rocks down? That's how you get free. You just did one of the bravest things a person can do.",
