        "reflection": "Knox mocked the hardest thing in your life right now — and you held your dignity through it. 🌱 The cruelest teasing targets real, painful family situations you're already hurting from. When someone mocks something genuinely hard — a divorce, a struggling family, a parent who's gone — that says everything about their cruelty and nothing about you or your family. A hard family situation isn't your fault, and it doesn't make your family 'broken' or you 'less loved.' Don't carry their meanness on top of real pain — tell a trusted adult about both, and lean on the people who love you.\" 💛 Important for kids: When your family is going through something hard — a divorce, a loss, a big change — and especially when someone is cruel about it, please talk to a trusted adult: a parent, a school counselor, or another grown-up you trust. You don't have to carry the heavy stuff alone, and none of it is your fault.",
